      "statement": "The graph executes via graph.ainvoke on a dedicated asyncio.SelectorEventLoop with thread_id set to the run id; TOKEN_CALLBACK, EXECUTION_EVENT_CALLBACK, and CANCEL_CHECK_CALLBACK context variables carry token streaming, execution-event streaming, and cancel checking across node boundaries.",
