      "statement": "Cancellation is cooperative: cancel() writes a cancel signal (a Redis key with a one-hour TTL in multi-instance mode) and marks the run cancelled; the DagScheduler consults the signal between batches and skips still-pending steps, and _run_message returns a cancelled envelope without persisting a full assistant message.",
